rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "nyx-dfs\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4LWRmcw==>> {
    rectangle "==Physics adapter\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe Physics implementation of dfs: descriptors, validation, solve entry." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Physicsadapter
    rectangle "==Typed problem\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe typed dfs problem the kernels read, decoded from the ProblemSpec envelope." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Typedproblem
    rectangle "==Heat kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nHeat transfer on P1/P2 simplices, stationary and transient." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Heatkernel
    rectangle "==Electrostatics kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nElectrostatics on P1/P2 simplices with fixed-potential, surface-charge, and multi-RHS terminal conditions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Electrostaticskernel
    rectangle "==Magnetostatics kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nGauge-stabilized London magnetostatics (2D cross-section, planar stream function, mixed 3D A-phi) and inductance matrix extraction." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Magnetostaticskernel
    rectangle "==Shared helpers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nPer-cell gradients and values shared by the heat and electrostatics kernels." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxdfs.Sharedhelpers
  }

  component "==nyx-physics\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Physics trait, the problem envelope (ProblemSpec), descriptors, SolveResult, the registry type, validation, JSON Schemas." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxphysics
  component "==femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe FEM core: meshes, meshing and adaptation, linear algebra behind one driver, finite-element basics, the material specification and library, expressions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.femcore
}

